The files in this directory are ported from @remotion/paths
(https://github.com/remotion-dev/remotion/tree/main/packages/paths, commit 4d9ff70e1f).
Each file's header names the source files it follows. Parts of @remotion/paths are
themselves taken from the projects listed after its licence, and their notices are kept here.

Motion Canvas's curve toolkit (motion-canvas/motion-canvas, MIT) was compared and not used:
its arc length is measured through a DOM SVGPathElement, which a pure f(t) core cannot call.

