--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
svg-path-properties (https://github.com/rveciana/svg-path-properties), by Roger Veciana i Rovira

@remotion/paths marks its parser and segment helpers "Copied from rveciana/svg-path-properties".
parse.ts, segment.ts and model.ts follow those helpers' approach and carry no copied lines (the
parser is rewritten and the quadrature nodes are computed, not tabled). svg-path-properties is
licensed ISC (checked against its npm registry metadata); since these files port its approach
and copy no lines, its licence text is not required here.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
fontello/svgpath (https://github.com/fontello/svgpath), a2c.js, by Vitaly Puzrin

The arc-to-cubic conversion in @remotion/paths' helpers/remove-a-s-t-curves.ts follows
svgpath's a2c. arc.ts implements the same SVG 1.1 appendix F.6 maths in its own structure.
